msgstr ""
"Before you can finish exiting Hyperspeed, you're greeted by an unusual "
"advertisement; \"Greetingsss valued Hektar customer! Thiss isss Billy "
"Hektar, CEO of the Hektar Corporation ssspeaking to you. Asss part of our "
"new cussstomer loyalty program, I am proud to introduce our new 'Unwavering "
"Wage Utility Points'! Each time you vissit a Hektar(tm) brand ssstore, our "
"friendly cussstomer support vesssselss will add an extra U.W.U. point to "
"your account! Collect enough, and you'll be able to enter our reward "
"program! Happy ssshopping!\" The advertisement concludes, and a cheerful "
"jingle plays over your computer, followed by the motto \"Satisfaction "
"guaranteed, because you aren't getting your money back!\""

